he clock to the base.":"Lawan jam sampe ke dasar.","Needlework":"Sulaman","Very narrow gaps. Precision is everything.":"Lubang sempit banget. Presisi itu segalanya.","Drift Storm":"Badai Nyelonong","Every layer drifts. Read the motion.":"Tiap lapis pada nyelonong. Baca gerakannya.","The Long Drop":"Jatuh Panjang Banget","Forty layers. Endurance and nerve.":"Empat puluh lapis. Tahan banting sama nyali.","Breaker":"Perusak","Danger everywhere — chain drops to smash through.":"Bahaya di mana-mana — rangkai drop buat ngehancurin.","Rotate the Tower":"Muter Menaranya","The tower turns; the ball does not. Rotate left and right with ←/→, A/D, the on-screen arrows, or by dragging.":"Menaranya muter; bola enggak. Muter kiri kanan pake ←/→, A/D, panah di layar, atau drag.","Find the Gap":"Cari Lubangnya","Line the glowing gap up with the ball and it drops through. Pass every layer to reach the base.":"Sejajarin lubang yang nyala sama bola terus dia bakal nyemplung lewat. Lewatin tiap lapis buat sampe ke dasar.","Danger Sectors":"Sektor Bahaya","Striped sectors are dangerous. Never land on one — rotate past them before you drop.":"Sektor bergaris bahaya. Jangan pernah mendarat di situ — muter lewat mereka sebelum lo jatuh.","Combos":"Kombinasi","Drop through several layers without landing for bonus points. Aligned gaps make a shaft — release and fall!":"Nyemplung lewat beberapa lapis tanpa mendarat buat dapet poin bonus. Lubang yang sejajar bikin shaft — lepas aja terus jatuh!","Smash Through":"Smash Lewat","Pass 3 layers in one drop and the ball charges up — the next danger sector shatters instead of stopping you.":"Lewatin 3 lapis dalam satu jatuh terus bola kecas — sektor bahaya berikutnya pecah, bukan nahan lo.","Cancel":"Batal","Erase":"Hapus","Key bindings":"Pengikatan kunci","Open Options":"Buka Opsi","Progress erased.":"Progres kehapus.","Progress restored from your StarHermit cloud save.":"Kemajuan dipulihkan dari StarHermit cloud save lu.","Run over":"Lari","Volumes,